abstract: >-
  Domain-neutral Python reference engine and reproducibility package for
  target-specific bounded inference under incomplete spatial evidence. The
  package includes unit tests, a frozen PAG-ETR M2/M4 fixture, exact semantic
  reproduction outputs, structural contract-sensitivity outputs, and a
  supplementary methodological workbook.
